.TH std::generator::promise_type::return_void 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::generator::promise_type::return_void \- std::generator::promise_type::return_void

.SH Synopsis
void return_void() const noexcept {}  (since C++23)

No-op. A user provided coroutine that uses the generator cannot issue a value via
co_return operator or reaching the end of the coroutine body.
